  "description": "Generic ONNX-Runtime infrastructure shared by DemaConsulting.Speech's raw-ONNX\n      model packages (models shipped only as bare ONNX graphs, with no bundled native inference\n      engine such as sherpa-onnx). This package owns only infrastructure common to any such model\n      - currently, GPU-then-CPU-fallback execution provider selection - and declares zero models\n      itself; each concrete model family ships in its own sibling package (for example\n      DemaConsulting.Speech.Onnx.Kokoro) that references this package and adds its own\n      AddXxxModels() extension method. Reference this package only transitively, via a model\n      package; core DemaConsulting.Speech itself ships with zero built-in models and has no\n      dependency on ONNX Runtime.",
  "iconFile": "Icon.png",
